"""Part 9b-ii-a mutations: the text box's layout and the UTF-8 decoder (game/text_box.cpp).

Run with the text build: --build build_text.bat --check check_text.py (TEXT_TEST; the "layout:"
checks in textbox_test.inc, the positioning faked). The deletions are named by the line they delete.

Equivalent (left alive, by design):
  B 78 del     a [[fallthrough]] attribute (the case falls through either way).
  B 116 cmp    a sequence's sum is never 0x7FFFFFFF (well formed: at most 0x10FFFF).
  B 516 cmp    DecodeUtf8 never returns 0.
  B 516 num    a byte decoded as itself (1 byte) read again as itself (ASCII).
  B 543 cmp    (the same as B 516 num, in Truncate.)
  B 543 num    (the same.)
  B 554 cmp    all fit: the text, or a copy of it of its length.
  B 570 cmp    a font size equal to the line's: the same.
  B 572 cmp    (the same, above.)
  B 574 cmp    (the same, below.)
  B 601 cmp    a column equal to the room: the same room.
  B 647 num    the flows' results are never below 0 (Layout tests only that).
  B 656 cmp    (the same as B 601 cmp, after a new line.)
  B 686 cmp    (the same as B 516 cmp, in FlowUtf8.)
  B 686 num    (the same as B 516 num.)
  B 698 cmp    (the same as B 601 cmp.)
  B 748 bool   Layout's false after a flow below 0, which none returns.
"""
